msgctxt "Wyndolyn"
msgid "You know what? Clearly, this was a mistake. You don't want to see the truth."
msgstr "Vous savez quoi ? De toute évidence, c'était une erreur. Vous refusez de voir la vérité."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: wyndolyn_window/wyndolyn_west_3/0/g-5/c-12/83/c-0/122/c-0/105 wyndolyn_window/wyndolyn_west_3/0/g-5/c-12/83/c-0/122/c-1/80 wyndolyn_window/wyndolyn_west_3/0/g-5/c-12/83/c-1/70/c-0/105 wyndolyn_window/wyndolyn_west_3/0/g-5/c-12/83/c-1/70/c-1/83 wyndolyn_window/wyndolyn_west_3/0/g-5/c-13/21/c-0/133/c-0/102 wyndolyn_window/wyndolyn_west_3/0/g-5/c-13/21/c-0/133/c-1/83
